      "name": "What are the best alternatives to JumpCloud Admin MCP?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "As of October 17, 2026, alternatives to JumpCloud Admin MCP in developer-tools on the Manufact MCP catalog include Held at the Gate, Speko, turva.dev, AgentMail, and Celesto Cloud Computers."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does JumpCloud Admin MCP MCP require authentication?",
